nd Edition, Green Tea Press, 2015, ISBN: 978-9352134755.","Charles Dierbach, \"Introduction to Computer Science Using Python\", 1st Edition, Wiley India Pvt Ltd. ISBN-13: 978-8126556014.","Wesley J Chun, \"Core Python Applications Programming\", 3rd Edition, Pearson Education India, 2015. ISBN-13: 978-9332555365."]}]'::jsonb from s;
