ics\", Cambridge University Press, 1989.","P.R. Gray, R.G. Meyer and S. Lewis, \"Analysis and Design of Analog Integrated Circuits\", John Wiley & Sons, 2001.","\"Fundamentals of Microelectronics\", B. Razavi, 2nd Edition.","\"Microelectronic Circuits\", A. S. Sedra and K. C. Smith, 7th Edition."]}]'::jsonb from s;
