Plan And Mine Closure Plan As Per IBM Guidelines","Statutory Clearances Required: Mining Lease Execution; Environmental Clearance (EC); Forest Clearance (FC); Consent To Establish (CTE) And Consent To Operate (CTO); DGMS Permissions (Safety & Health)","Land Acquisition And Rehabilitation (LARR Act, 2013)","Infrastructure Development: Roads, Power, Water, Housing, And Communication","Unit 4.0: Financial, Economic And Contractual Aspects (8 hrs) Components Of Mine Project Cost And Capital Budgeting Financial Modeling For Mine Development Projects Mine Financing Options: Public-Private Partnerships, Bank Loans, Equity, And FDI Contract Mining, Joint Ventures, And Mine Developer & Operator (MDO) Model Cost Estimation For Overburden Removal, Production, And Logistics Royalties, Taxes, And Statutory Payments (DMF, NMET, Etc)","Components Of Mine Project Cost And Capital Budgeting","Financial Modeling For Mine Development Projects","Mine Financing Options: Public-Private Partnerships, Bank Loans, Equity, And FDI","Contract Mining, Joint Ventures, And Mine Developer & Operator (MDO) Model","Cost Estimation For Overburden Removal, Production, And Logistics","Royalties, Taxes, And Statutory Payments (DMF, NMET, Etc)"]},{"title":"Sustainable And Safe Mine Operationalization I (5 hrs)","topics":["Environmental And Social Governance (ESG) Aspects Of Sustainable Mine Development Practices","Health, Safety, And Environmental (HSE) Management Plan For New Mines","Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) In Mine Start-Up Areas"]},{"title":"Sustainable And Safe Mine Operationalization II (4 hrs)","topics":["Monitoring, Reporting, And Compliance Post-Commissioning","Recent Trends: Automation, Digitalization, And Green Mining Initiatives","Mines And Minerals (Development And Regulation) Act, 1957 And Allied Rules. Government Of India Government Of India","Mine Management, Legislation And General Safety Ranjan Kumar Lovely Prakashan, ASIN : B09CF591NS","Guidelines For Mining Plans And Clos