isk Assessment","Ethical Responsibility","Continuous Improvement Practices And Inclusion Of Green Mining Concepts","Statutory Provisions: Relevant Provisions Under Mines Act And CMR/MMR","Safety Regulations For Haulage And Conveyors And Compliance Requirements","Design and Selection of Bulk Material Handling Equipment and Systems (Vol. I & II), Jayanta Bhattacharya Wide Educational Products and Services, India","Material Handling Systems: Designing for Safety and Health, C. Reese, CRC Press","Mine Hoisting M. A. Ramlu, Oxford & IBH","Mine Winding and Transport S. C. Walker, Elsevier","Accident Reports and Safety Guidelines, DGMS Circulars Government of India Publications","SME Mining Engineering Handbook (2 Vols.), Society for Mining, Metallurgy & Exploration (SME), SME","Open Pit Mine Planning & Design (Vol. I: Fundamentals) W. Hustrulid & M. Kuchta, CRC Press / Balkema."]}]'::jsonb from s;
