earn From Others: Seek Diverse Experiences And Knowledge Stay Positive: Focus On Opportunities And Solutions","Practice Gratitude: Focus On The Positive Aspects Of Life","Stay Curious: Embrace Lifelong Learning","Be Open-minded: Consider Different Perspectives","Develop Flexibility: Adjust To Changing Circumstances","Practice Self-awareness: Recognize Your Emotions And Thoughts","Take Calculated Risks: Step Out Of Your Comfort Zone","Learn From Others: Seek Diverse Experiences And Knowledge","Stay Positive: Focus On Opportunities And Solutions"]},{"title":"Personal Growth (5 hrs)","topics":["Mindfulness And Stress Management","Time Management And Productivity"]},{"title":"Well-being (3 hrs)","topics":["Physical And Mental Well-being","The Art of Living, Sri Sri Ravi Shankar, HarperCollins UK, 2014 9789351066385.","You Can Win Shiv Khera Bloomsbury India; 1st edition, (2014) 978-9832951711.","The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People Stephen Covey, adapted by Suresh Mansharamani, Simon & Schuster; 12th edition (2019) 978-2133487538.","The Gita for Success V. Srinivasan V&S Publishers, New Delhi","Yoga and the Art of Living B.K.S. Iyengar, Harpercollins (2005), 978-8172235253.","Employability Skills Dr. Nishith Rajaram Dubey, Anupam Singh, Indra Publishing House, 2023, ISBN 978-93-93577-68-9.","Organizational Behavior A. K. Chitale, Rajendra Prasad Mohanty and Dr Nishith Dubey, PHI Learning Pvt Ltd, ISBN 978-81-203-4696-3.","Managerial Skills Dr Nishith Dubey & Prof Gitanjali Shrivastava Shiva Prakashan, Indore, India, 2010, ISBN 81-7677-100-7,","Emotional Intelligence, Daniel Goleman, Word Press. Com, 9789382563792","How to win friends and influence people, Dale Carnegie Srishti Publishers & Distributors, Delhi, India."]}]'::jsonb from s;
insert into public.syllabus_versions (syllabus_id,version,units) select id,1,'[{"title":"Values and Ethics in Day to Day Life I (7","topics":["Introduction To Values And Ethics","Definition","Examples","Concept Of Attitude And Development Of Attitude","Importance Of Values And Ethics In Day To Day Activities And At Workplace"]},{"title":"Values and Ethics in Day to Day Life II (7","topics":["Ethical Ways Of Communication","Ethical Ways To Demonstrate Environmental Considerations In Engineering Processes In The Context Of Carbon","Ethics At Workplace","Examples Of Situations Depicting Values- Based Decisions And Ethical Behaviour In Day To Day Life"]},{"title":"Values and Ethics in Profession II (7 hrs)","topics":["Relevance Of Profession To Society","Ethical Principles Such As Respecting Others And Ourselves","Respecting The Rights Of Others","Keeping Promises","Avoiding Unnecessary Problems To Others","Avoiding Cheating And Dishonesty","Expressing Gratitude Towards Others And Encouraging Them To Work3"]},{"title":"Values and Ethics in Profession II (7 hrs)","topics":["Identification Of Activities In One''s Own Area Of Work And Related Ethical And Unethical Behavior","Identification Of Ethical And Unethical Behavior In Profession Related To One''s Own Discipline","Examples / Cases Of Situations Depicting Values- Based Decisions And Ethical Behavior"]},{"title":"Introduction to sustainability and 5R Approach I (7 hrs)","topics":["Sustainable Development: Concept And Environmental Ethics","Impact Of Development On Ecosystem: Panch-tatva - (पंच-तत्व)''"]},{"title":"Introduction to sustainability and 5R Approach II (7 hrs)","topics":["Role Of 5Rs For Sustainable Development","National Guidelines On The Economic","Social And Environmental Responsibilities Of Business","Professional Ethics and Human Values, D. R. Kiran, McGraw-Hill Education Pvt. Ltd. 2007, ISBN: 9780070633872","A Textbook On Professional Ethics And Human Values, Dr. RS Nagarajan, New Age International (P) Ltd., Publishers, 2017, R.S. Naagarazan, ISBN: 8122419380, 9788122419382.","Ethics, Integrity and Aptitude - Hindi (Paperback), (एथिक्स, सत्यनिष्ठा एवं अभिवृत्ति), P.D Sharma, Rawat Publications, 2019, ISBN: 978-8131609941","Chanakya - Niti (Sutra Sahit) (Hindi), Chanakya, Maple Press. 2014, ISBN 978-9350335529, Environment and sustainable development (Digital Book by NCERT) https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/keec107.pdf.NCERT, NCERT, New Delhi."]}]'::jsonb from s;
insert into public.syllabus_versions (syllabus_id,version,units) select id,1,'[{"title":"Unit","topics":["Unit-1.0: Introduction to Value Education: (7 hrs) Right Understanding Relationship And Physical Facility (Holistic Development And The Role Of Education) Understanding Value Education Sharing About Oneself Self-exploration As The Process For Value Education Continuous Happiness And Prosperity The Basic Human Aspirations Exploring Human Consciousness Happiness And Prosperity - Current Scenario Method To Fulfill The Basic Human Aspirations","Right Understanding","Relationship And Physical Facility (Holistic Development And The Role Of Education)","Understanding Value Education Sharing About Oneself","Self-exploration As The Process For Value Education","Continuous Happiness And Prosperity The Basic Human Aspirations","Exploring Human Consciousness","Happiness And Prosperity - Current Scenario","Method To Fulfill The Basic Human Aspirations"]},{"title":"Harmony in the Human Being: (7 hrs)","topics":["Understanding Human Being As The Co-existence Of The Self And The Body","Distinguishing Between The Needs Of The Self And The Body","The Body As An Instrument Of The Self","Understanding Harmony In The Self","Harmony Of The Self With The Body","Programme To Ensure Self-regulation And Health"]},{"title":"Harmony in the Family and Society: (7 hrs)","topics":["Harmony In The Family The Basic Unit Of Human Interaction","''Trust'' The Foundational Value In Relationship","''Respect'' - As The Right Evaluation","Other Feelings","Justice In Human-to-Human Relationship","Understanding Harmony In The Society","Vision For The Universal Human Order"]},{"title":"Harmony in the Nature/Existence (7 hrs)","topics":["Understanding Harmony In The Nature","Interconnectedness","Self-regulation And Mutual Fulfilment Among The Four Orders Of Nature","Realizing Existence As Co-existence At All Levels","The Holistic Perception Of Harmony In Existence"]},{"title":"Implications of the Holistic Understanding - a Look at Professional","topics":["Natural Acceptance Of Human Values","Definitiveness Of (Ethical) Human Conduct","A Basis For Humanistic Education","Humanistic Constitution And Universal Human Order"]},{"title":"(7 hrs)","topics":["Competence In Professional Ethics","Holistic Technologies","Production Systems And Management Models-Typical Case Studies","Strategies For Transition Towards Value-based Life And Profession","A Foundation Course in Human Values and Professional Ethics, RR Gaur, R Asthana, G P Bagaria, 2nd Revised Edition, Excel Books, New Delhi, 2019. ISBN 978-93-8703447.","Jeevan Vidya: EkParichaya, A Nagaraj, Jeevan VidyaPrakashan, Amarkantak, 1999.","Human Values, A.N. Tripathi, New Age Intl. Publishers, New Delhi, 2004.","The Story of Stuff (Book).","The Story of My Experiments with Truth - by Mohandas Karamchand Gandhi.","Small is Beautiful - E. F Schumacher.","Slow is Beautiful - Cecile Andrews."]}]'::jsonb from s;
insert into public.syllabus_versions (syllabus_id,version,units) select id,1,'[{"title":"Unit","topics":["Unit 1.0: Atomic and Molecular Structure Electromagnetic radiations Dual nature of electron and Heisenberg uncertainty Principle Photoelectric effect Planck''s theory Principles for the combination of atomic orbitals to form a molecular diagram of molecular orbitals Bent''s rule VSEPR theory (typical example) Coordination numbers and geometries Isomerism in transition metal compounds Metal Carbonyls: Synthesis and Structure","Electromagnetic radiations","Dual nature of electron and Heisenberg uncertainty Principle","Photoelectric effect","Planck''s theory","Principles for the combination of atomic orbitals to form a molecular diagram of molecular orbitals","Bent''s rule","VSEPR theory (typical example)","Coordination numbers and geometries","Isomerism in transition metal compounds","Metal Carbonyls: Synthesis and Structure"]},{"title":"Spectroscopy","topics":["Principle of rotational and vibrational spectroscopy","Selection rule for application in diatomic molecules","Elementary idea of electronic spectroscopy","UV-VIS spectroscopy with related to rules and its applications","Basic Principle of nuclear Magnetic resonance spectroscopy with applications"]},{"title":"Electrochemistry and Fuels","topics":["Nernst equation","EMF and electrochemical cell","Introduction of corrosion","Corrosion mechanism","Types of corrosion","Water line corrosion","Stress corrosion","Pitting corrosion","Lead acid storage cell","Leclanche cell","Calorific value of fuels","Proximate and ultimate analysis of coals","Fuel cells","Bio fuels"]},{"title":"Water Chemistry","topics":["Hardness of water","Estimation of water hardness by EDTA and Alkalinity method","Removal of the hardness of water: soda lime process, zeolite process, Ion exchange process","Boiler problem","Sludge and scale formation","Priming and foaming","Boiler corrosion","Caustic embrittlement","Unit 5.0: Polymer and Plastic